{"obsah":"<p>After a year we once again held a bike day camp. Putting the team together took relatively long, but in the end we assembled a great group of bikers and leaders who prepared an interesting five days on the bike for more than 27 boys and girls. The weather was against us at first, but a proper biker rides in all weathers. Honza Havránek could tell you all about that as a downhiller. Michal Budský as a Trial rider would have a harder time, but he is a versatile rider with experience across several disciplines. The guys also had young guns Tobík and Dan, who helped with everything our capable leaders Lenka and Klárka needed. Vlasta was in charge of preparation, building, Trial training and a few other small things.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The riders were skilful and there wasn't a single one who didn't improve. A competition every day, the occasional small crash (luckily nothing serious) and enthusiasm for riding from all the boys and girls.</p>\n\n<p>Thank you for the feedback from parents and kids – hopefully we'll manage to organise another edition.</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<p>Photo by Mr Větrovec</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F07%2F516450880_24440723905520144_589936030956086420_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F07%2F516450880_24440723905520144_589936030956086420_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250912\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F07%2F516692447_24440720082187193_4243797824281123792_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebases